*-------------------------------------------------------- 1 redef_lastwins XFAIL
*  M1-R4b witness 2: redefinition must be LAST-WINS -- the second DEFINE
*  re-points the same function name at a different body label.
        DEFINE('F(x)','F1')                                                                  :(FEnd)
F1      F          =     'first:' x                                                          :(RETURN)
F2      F          =     'second:' x                                                         :(RETURN)
FEnd
        OUTPUT     =     F('a')
        DEFINE('F(x)','F2')
        OUTPUT     =     F('b')
END
